      "description": "A Black man is centrally positioned in the image, with a serious, confrontational expression, overlaid with text that reads: 'until you give the white man back his god, everything i post is going to offend you.' The text is framed as a direct, racially charged declaration, implying that any expression of Black identity will offend white audiences. The man's posture and expression visually reinforce the confrontational tone of the text.",
