      "description": "The meme implies that white people have a 'god' (a cultural or religious narrative) that must be 'given back' for Black people to be allowed to express themselves without offense. This reflects a racist belief that white cultural norms are superior and that non-white people are inherently disruptive to them.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
