      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The speaker is mapped onto the Black man in the image",
      "description": "The text 'everything i post is going to offend you' is attributed to the speaker, who is visually represented by the Black man in the image. The meme uses the man's image to embody the speaker's identity and perspective, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the man) represents the textual entity (the speaker).",
